WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.006 --> 00:00:02.218
Ligar o follow-up automático da IA

2
00:00:02.218 --> 00:00:05.480
Abra CRM no menu lateral

3
00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:08.680
Clique em Kanban

4
00:00:08.681 --> 00:00:12.199
Clique em Editar funil

5
00:00:12.199 --> 00:00:13.790
Role até Follow-up automático

6
00:00:13.791 --> 00:00:17.004
Ative o follow-up automático

7
00:00:17.004 --> 00:00:20.176
Escolha IA cria lembrete para a equipe

8
00:00:20.176 --> 00:00:23.065
Escreva o tom da marca

9
00:00:23.065 --> 00:00:26.266
Clique em Salvar IA

10
00:00:26.266 --> 00:00:28.472
Pronto
